        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "An evil being known as Ligar is about to conquer the land of Argool. Such is his power that no living creature dares to cross paths with him. But the legendary warrior Rygar rises from his grave to restore peace and justice. Armed with his famed weapon Diskarmor, Rygar begins to traverse the vast lands that lead to the lair of the demon, as his minions are trying in vain to stop him...",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un ser malvado conocido como Ligar está a punto de conquistar la tierra de Argool. Tal es su poder que ninguna criatura viviente se atreve a cruzarse en su camino. Pero el legendario guerrero Rygar se alza desde su tumba para restaurar la paz y la justicia. Armado con su famosa arma, el Diskarmor, Rygar comienza a recorrer las vastas tierras que conducen a la guarida del demonio, mientras sus secuaces intentan en vano detenerlo...",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
