        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "This is a 3D-based sequel to Rygar, a Tecmo title which was successful in the arcades and on many home systems.\n\nIn the land of Argos, Princess Harmonia is kidnapped by the Titans, who are led by ancient gods Cleopatra and a winged-demon character named Aristotle, in an attempt to release the evil spirit of Cronus. A young gladiator in training named Rygar hears her cries for help, and rushes to her rescue.\n\nArmed with a legendary device called the Diskarmor, Rygar will explore the land of Argos, destroying enemies and powerful demons, while finding items and seeking information to aid him in his search for Princess Harmonia. Once Rygar has powered up his Diskarmor, it is up to him to stop Cleopatra and Aristotle, save the Princess and all of Argos from evil.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Esta es una secuela en 3D de Rygar, un título de Tecmo que tuvo éxito en los recreativos y en numerosas consolas domésticas.\n\nEn la tierra de Argos, la princesa Harmonia es secuestrada por los Titans, liderados por los dioses antiguos Cleopatra y un demonio alado llamado Aristotle, en un intento de liberar al espíritu maligno de Cronus. Un joven gladiador en entrenamiento llamado Rygar oye sus gritos de auxilio y acude de inmediato a rescatarla.\n\nArmado con un dispositivo legendario llamado Diskarmor, Rygar explorará la tierra de Argos, destruyendo enemigos y poderosos demonios, mientras encuentra objetos y busca información que le ayude en su búsqueda de la princesa Harmonia. Una vez que Rygar haya potenciado su Diskarmor, le corresponderá detener a Cleopatra y Aristotle, y salvar a la princesa y a todo Argos del mal.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
